  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Death Ray engineer trick</p><p>A mad enough engineer finds ways to overcome the raw limitations on his death ray's output. By spending a full round charging his death ray, the engineer can expends 2 of the death ray's daily uses on any shot made the following round to increase all of the damage dice by one step (One-handed 1d4 -> 1d6; Two-handed 1d6 -> 1d8), and double the engineer's Intelligence modifier on damage. If the overcharge is not used during the following round, a daily use of the death ray is expended with no effect.</p>",
